        spokenEn: "Surrounding the temple are nine expansive ponds representing green lotus leaves. Fresh air passes over the water surfaces, cooling as it enters subterranean ventilation grilles into the central hall, while warm air escapes through the roof skylight\u2014generating natural continuous convective cooling.",
