        spokenEn: "Built in classical Kalinga style, the curvilinear Rekha Deula spire rises 65 meters, crowned by the eight-metal Nilachakra disc. A priest scales the 214-foot dome daily without ropes to change the Patitapavana flag, which miraculously flutters opposite to the prevailing wind direction.",
